extends layout 
block title 
    title About Us
block content
    .title 
        div(class="page_header")
            a(href="/about")
                button About Us
            a(href="/create_blog")
                button Get Started
            a(href="/login")
                button Login 
            a(href="/dashboard")
                button Dash board
        h1 Adventure of Your Life
        div(class="about_intro")
            p Discover the world's most breathtaking camping and hiking destinations through the eyes of fellow adventurers. Whether you're a seasoned mountaineer or just starting your outdoor journey, TrailStories is your gateway to authentic experiences from nature lovers around the globe.
    div(class="about_content")
        div(class="about_stories")
            h2 Real Stories, Real Adventures
            p Explore detailed accounts from campers and hikers who've walked the trails before you. From hidden alpine lakes to coastal campsites, desert canyons to forest retreats, our community shares honest insights about what makes each location special.
            h2 Connect with Fellow Explorers
            p Join a global community of outdoor enthusiasts who share your passion for nature. Exchange tips, ask questions, share photos, and find hiking partners. Whether you're planning a solo trek or a family camping trip, you'll find support and inspiration here.
            h2 Contribute Your Own Journey
            p Been somewhere extraordinary? Share your story! Your experiences help others discover new places and prepare for their own adventures. Rate locations, post reviews, upload photos, and become part of a growing network that's mapping the world's outdoor treasures, one trail at a time.
            #get_start
                a(href="/resources/templates/create.pug") 
                    button Get Started
    div(class="blog-grid")
        h2 Recently
        if recent_blog
            each blog in recent_blog
                a.blog_card(href=`/blog/${blog.id}`)
                    div(class="blog_content")
                        h3.blog_title= blog.title 
                        p.blog_excerpt= blog.content.substring(0, 150) + '...'
                        .blog-meta
                            .blog-author
                            span= blog.author_name